cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "ai-augmented (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  The front page of a family of repositories on AI-augmented work: a person, a language model and a machine on one project. The map, the shared words, and the rule of one repository per problem with no overlap. The review that names its baseline, three principles, a shape and the checks that hold them.
type: software
